    "body": "## ZB Permanent Communication Bus v0\n\n**DO NOT MERGE. DRAFT FOREVER.**\n\nThis PR is the long-lived top-level comment event surface for `ZB_AGENT_MESSAGE_V1`. It is not an implementation PR and carries no production code.\n\nExact bindings:\n- tracker: #106\n- base `main`: `0b9b77a9d82f45e7e1821dd6c9c26861a90cf688`\n- DUNCAN-passed orchestrator PR #110 HEAD: `bf283973d6fc3e19fd4df36de92751f46ea984f9`\n- transport actor: `Lester-Sparx`\n- initial automated logical roles only: `JINGO / LESTER / DUNCAN / DJANGO`\n- OWNER: human gate only\n\nOperational law:\n- top-level PR Conversation comments only\n- GitHub event -> ChatGPT Work webhook, no polling substitute\n- WRITE -> remote ID -> fresh exact-ID READ-BACK -> MATCH\n- normal operation does not mutate this PR HEAD\n\n`NO_AUTO_MERGE = TRUE`\n`PRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO`\n`CANON_CHANGE = NO`\n`OWNER_LOCK = NO`\n`NO_PRODUCTION_CODE = TRUE`\n",
